observed = "nativeToWei accepts any number of fractional digits and slices the fraction to 18. For example 0.0000000000000000001 becomes 0, and 1.0000000000000000009 becomes 1000000000000000000 without warning. Its current SendTxForm consumer is unused, so this is an exported helper risk rather than a claim of a live transfer loss."
